div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"64.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"33.0\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,73.5 9.1,60.9 14.2,59.0 19.3,68.2 24.5,58.0 29.6,58.6 34.7,56.6 39.8,47.3 44.9,46.6 50.0,38.5 55.1,36.8 60.3,45.6 65.4,55.5 70.5,38.0 75.6,16.4 80.7,12.8 85.8,12.8 91.0,27.5 96.1,38.0 101.2,42.8 106.3,49.2 111.4,42.7 116.5,38.2 121.6,38.6 126.8,37.4 131.9,50.3 137.0,56.6 142.1,58.9 147.2,56.4 152.3,60.6 157.4,69.0 162.6,67.6 167.7,79.7 172.8,77.7 177.9,73.5 183.0,75.0 188.1,83.4 193.2,62.2 198.4,45.0 203.5,53.4 208.6,41.4 213.7,46.3 218.8,17.8 223.9,66.0 229.0,57.1 234.2,59.3 239.3,51.5 244.4,52.8 249.5,58.7 254.6,71.9 259.7,64.2 264.9,66.1 270.0,70.1 275.1,70.6 280.2,66.2 285.3,61.3 290.4,54.0 295.5,60.9 300.7,51.1 305.8,43.8 310.9,31.5 316.0,56.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fi